{'symbol': 'LLY', 'date': '2022-10-17 12:04:00', 'title': 'LILLY DECLARES FOURTH-QUARTER 2022 DIVIDEND', 'text': 'INDIANAPOLIS , OCT. 17, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF ELI LILLY AND COMPANY (NYSE: LLY) HAS DECLARED A DIVIDEND FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER OF 2022 OF $0.98 PER SHARE ON OUTSTANDING COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON\xa0DEC. 9, 2022 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON\xa0NOV. 15, 2022.'}